    "title": "Man accused of killing Portland woman next to her baby returned to West Coast to face charges, police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Isabel Funk ,\n3 hours ago The man accused in the 2024 killing of a Portland woman found bloody in her car next to her 1-year-old son has been brought back to the West Coast to face charges. Dariel Nunez Montero, 32, was arrested in Kentucky last year in connection to the death of 31-year-old Courtney V. Clinton. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
